      "source": "@verbose 0.1.0\nconcept Input\n  @intention: \"Bound a numeric code-size fixture\"\n  @source: deep.intent:1\n  fields:\n    x : number [-10, 10]\n    y : number [1, 5]\nrule checked\n  @intention: \"Check an impossible arm before removing its arithmetic\"\n  @source: deep.intent:1\n  input:\n    i : Input\n  output:\n    out : number\n  logic:\n    out = if i.x != 0 then if i.x == 0 then i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y + (i.y)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))) else i.x else 0\n  proofs:\n    purity:\n      reads : [i.x, i.y]\n      calls : []\n    termination:\n      bound : 1000\n  hints:\n    overflow : [-1000, 1000]\n",
